# Prithviraj Chauhan Animated Webpage (With Image)

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Prithviraj Chauhan</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e,#16213e,#0f3460,#533483);
    background-size:400% 400%;
    animation:bgAnimation 12s ease infinite;
    color:white;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

@keyframes bgAnimation{
    0%{background-position:0% 50%;}
    50%{background-position:100% 50%;}
    100%{background-position:0% 50%;}
}

.hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px;
}

.hero img{
    width:350px;
    max-width:90%;
    border-radius:20px;
    border:5px solid gold;
    box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,215,0,0.7);
    animation:float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
    0%{transform:translateY(0px);}
    50%{transform:translateY(-15px);}
    100%{transform:translateY(0px);}
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:4rem;
    margin-top:25px;
    color:#ffd700;
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    animation:fadeIn 2s ease;
}

.hero p{
    margin-top:20px;
    max-width:900px;
    line-height:1.8;
    font-size:1.2rem;
    animation:fadeInUp 2s ease;
}

@keyframes fadeIn{
    from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(-40px);
    }
    to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0);
    }
}

@keyframes fadeInUp{
    from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(40px);
    }
    to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0);
    }
}

.section{
    padding:80px 10%;
}

.section h2{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:3rem;
    color:#ffcc00;
    margin-bottom:50px;
}

.cards{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
    gap:30px;
}

.card{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:20px;
    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    transition:0.5s;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-10px) scale(1.03);
    box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,215,0,0.6);
}

.card h3{
    color:#ffd700;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.card p{
    line-height:1.7;
}

.quote{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:2rem;
    color:#fff2a8;
    padding:70px 20px;
    animation:pulse 3s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse{
    0%{transform:scale(1);}
    50%{transform:scale(1.05);}
    100%{transform:scale(1);}
}

footer{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    font-size:1rem;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="hero">

    <!-- Prithviraj Chauhan Image -->
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Prithviraj_Chauhan.jpg" alt="Prithviraj Chauhan">

    <h1>Prithviraj Chauhan</h1>

    <p>
        Prithviraj Chauhan was one of the bravest Rajput kings in Indian history.
        He ruled Ajmer and Delhi during the 12th century and became famous for his
        courage, leadership, swordsmanship, and patriotism.
    </p>
</div>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Achievements</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Ruler of Ajmer & Delhi</h3>
            <p>
                Prithviraj Chauhan expanded his kingdom and became one of the most
                powerful kings of northern India.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Victory Against Muhammad Ghori</h3>
            <p>
                He defeated Muhammad Ghori in the First Battle of Tarain in 1191,
                showing extraordinary bravery and military skills.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Master Archer</h3>
            <p>
                He was famous for the legendary skill called “Shabd Bhedi Baan”,
                where he could hit targets by sound.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Bravery</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Fearless Warrior</h3>
            <p>
                He fought many battles bravely and always protected his kingdom
                with honor and courage.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Rajput Pride</h3>
            <p>
                His bravery became a symbol of Rajput pride and Indian valor.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Legendary Hero</h3>
            <p>
                Even today, Prithviraj Chauhan is remembered as one of India's
                greatest warriors.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<div class="quote">
    “A warrior lives for honor, courage, and his motherland.”
</div>

<footer>
    Animated Tribute to Prithviraj Chauhan 🇮🇳
</footer>

</body>
</html>
